SUMMARY:The Fertilizer Show
LOCATION:Tampa Convention Center 333 S Franklin St Tampa \, FL 33602 Unite
 d States
DESCRIPTION:The Fertilizer Show is the global gathering of the entire fert
 ilizer production supply chain\, acting as the meeting place to discuss th
 e latest technologies for a sustainable\, efficient fertilizer industry. T
 he exhibition will be an essential meeting place for fertilizer producers 
 to source suppliers and meet experts able to assist them in creating effic
 ient\, cost effective\, products with a strong focus on sustainability and
  emissions reduction. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/191251
